#649: FILE: sound/usb/midi.c:482:
+		if (ep->in_sysex &&
+		    cin == ep->last_cin &&
+		    (buffer[i + 1 + (cin == 0x6)] & 0x80) == 0)

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

